      "imageWidth": 1692,
      "imageHeight": 3320,
      "story": "Mihrab, also known as Genesis is a painting of 1901 by the Turkish artist Osman Hamdi Bey.",
      "facts": [
        "The painting was first exhibited in May 1903 at the Royal Academy Exhibition in London under the French title La Genèse, which has been interpreted as a reference to the subject's possible pregnancy.",
